 <text type="manuscript">
  <body>
   <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="tex_bb.00009.jpg" type="recto"/>
     <note type="archival" place="top" rend="circled" hand="#h02">1</note>
   <lg type="poem">
    <head rend="underline">On, on <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">awhile,</del> <add place="above" seq="2">the same,</add></subst> ye jocund twain!</head>
     <l>On, on <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">awhile,</del> <add place="above" seq="2">the same,</add></subst> ye jocund twain!</l>
    <l>My life and <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">verse,</del> <add place="below" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a001" seq="2">recitative,</add></subst>
       combining birth, <del rend="overstrike">and</del> youth,<lb/>
          <del rend="overstrike">and</del> mid-age years,</l>
     <l>Fitful as tongues of flame inseparably twined and<lb/>
      <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a002">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a002">motley&#11840;</add>merged <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">in</del> <add place="above" seq="2">of</add></subst> one;</l>
     <l>My single soul&#8212;aims, confirmations, <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a003">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" rend="marked" xml:id="a003">failures,</add> <subst><add place="above" seq="2">joys&#8212;</add><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">lights&#8212;</del></subst>nor<lb/>
           single soul alone,</l>
    
     <l>My nation's crucial <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">time</del> <add place="above" seq="2">stage</add></subst> (America's, haply<lb/>
           humanity's,)&#8212;its trial great and victory great,</l>
    
     <l><subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">To-day's</del> <add place="below" seq="2"><metamark function="add" target="#a004">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a004" seq="2">My land's</add></subst> <hi rend="underline"><choice><sic>ecclairecissement</sic><corr>éclaircissement</corr></choice></hi> of all the <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a015">&#8248;</metamark></add><add hand="#h01" place="above" xml:id="a015">masses</add> past, the<lb/>
     eastern world, <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">old times,</del> <add place="above" seq="2">ancient,</add></subst> medieval,</l>
    
     <l>Here from <del rend="overstrike">their</del> wanderings, strayings, lessons, wars<lb/>
           &#8212;here at the west at last triumphant!</l>
    
     <l>A gladsome pealing cry&#8212;a song of pride and<lb/>
           satisfaction!</l>
    
     <l>I chant the <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a005">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a005">common</add> bulk, <del rend="overstrike">the</del> <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a006">&#8248;</metamark></add><del rend="overstrike"><add place="above" xml:id="a006">horde,</add></del> <add place="above" rend="marked">the</add> general average <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a007">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a007">horde,</add> (the best<lb/> 
           no sooner than the worst)&#8212;I chant old age,</l>
    
     <l>(My verses, <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">made</del> <del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add place="above" seq="2">sung</add></del></subst> <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a008">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" rend="marked" xml:id="a008">written <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">out)</del> <add seq="2">first)</add></subst></add> for early life, and <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">through</del> <add place="above" seq="2">for</add></subst><lb/>
      <del rend="overstrike">mid-span,</del> <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a009">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a009">the</add> summer's, <del rend="overstrike">and</del> autumn's spread,</l>
    
     <l>I <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">keep for</del> <add place="above" seq="2">pass to</add></subst> snow-white hairs the same, and give to<lb/>
           pulses winter&#8212;cool'd the same;)</l>
    
     <l><del rend="overstrike"><subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">Through peace and war,</del> <add place="above" seq="2">On, on, awhile,</add></subst>
       ye twain&#8212;through many<lb/>
      problems, curious idle meditations&#8212;<add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a010">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a010">yet,&#8212;</add>and now&#8212;</del></l>
    
    <l>And now, <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a011">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a011" rend="marked">in careless chant, <del rend="overstrike">the</del> myself,</add> <del rend="overstrike">old age of me,</del> with <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a012">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a012">faith and</add> love,</l>
    
    <l>Waft<subst><del rend="strike" seq="1">ed</del><add place="above" seq="1">ing</add></subst> to <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">to finishing stages</del> <add place="above" seq="2">other work &#8212;</add></subst><del rend="overstrike">changes,</del> 
     <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a013">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a013" rend="marked">unknown <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a016">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" rend="marked" xml:id="a016">conditions,</add> joys,</add> <del rend="overstrike">just the same,</del></l>
    
     <l>On, on, ye jocund twain! <del rend="overstrike">on,</del> <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a014">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a014">continue</add> on, the same!</l>
   </lg>
   <signed rend="underline">Walt Whitman</signed>
